Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:03.92,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,работали,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Над серией работали:\N Лилия, Тирамису, Ананас, Зингер, Февраль
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(110,602)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\pos(112,666)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:13.41,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,1 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.70,0:01:26.90,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Even the most evil dog
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:28.79,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,will not bite the hand that feeds him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:30.16,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,He will wag his tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.47,0:01:33.37,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,When I started cooking at 13,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.37,0:01:36.27,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I dreamed of working in the Blue House.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:39.57,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I wanted to become the one who feeds the most influential person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.11,0:01:42.07,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,So I became a chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.55,0:01:45.18,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You mentioned earlier that you became
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.18,0:01:47.35,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,the youngest cook in the Blue House.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:49.08,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,-I became the first.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:56.65,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:01:59.06,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Cod.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.84,0:02:03.96,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.71,0:02:11.94,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,The ambassador does not tolerate bones in fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:13.34,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.08,0:02:15.27,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:19.82,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,If you repeat this again,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.82,0:02:21.81,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I will only give him the head of the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.22,0:02:27.62,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,The chef cooks the fish himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:29.10,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.10,0:02:31.12,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,He is Emperor Qin Shi Huang, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:32.59,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Qin Shihuang?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.30,0:02:36.49,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Fish pie was invented for Qin Shihuang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:38.94,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Emperor Qin Shihuang was so powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.94,0:02:41.01,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,that when he ate his favorite fish every day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:42.64,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,and he came across a bone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:45.17,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,he cut off the head of the one who prepared it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:48.75,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Every day the cooks died,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:50.51,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,and one day the new boss thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.22,0:02:53.12,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,that death awaits him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:55.59,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,In despair, he mechanically
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:58.95,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,cutting fish on a cutting board.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:00.98,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Eureka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:04.22,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,He was very lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.53,0:03:09.56,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,It may surprise you that one person kills another for food,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:11.53,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,but this is not just food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:15.70,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,A properly prepared dish will melt the hardest heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:20.40,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,This is the most charming weapon in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:26.18,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,This is exactly what I think when I cook in the Blue House.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:29.55,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,"Cooking is politics."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:32.96,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Since we touched on this topic, answer the questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:35.39,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,which everyone is interested in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.39,0:03:38.85,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,For example, what are the secrets in the Blue House?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:42.06,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,First, I want to clarify something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:44.23,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,My name will not be revealed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:47.16,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,and will pay in cash. Fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:56.35,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Camera? There was a short circuit due to a leak,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.35,0:03:57.67,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,hasn't worked all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:02.55,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Did it break itself, or did someone break it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:06.72,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,There are times when you have to turn a blind eye to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:10.65,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Thanks to this, I was lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:14.47,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Is it normal that we are here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.47,0:04:17.07,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,After serving the main course, the game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.07,0:04:20.10,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Right now the Chinese ambassador is tasting heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:32.61,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.67,0:04:48.86,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Chief Chan! Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:51.79,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Chief Chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:54.80,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,-Where are you?\N-Bummers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:57.43,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,It's tiring to be so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:05:00.48,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,The Ambassador liked my food so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:02.61,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,what does he personally want to thank?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:04.85,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Be back soon, Seongyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:06.31,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,My name is Hyejeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:09.08,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Seongyeon suits you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:24.16,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,1 episode: Jang Bong-hwan in Wonderland
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:30.33,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Angry dog. It might bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:41.61,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:43.71,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Tek, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:47.03,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Jang Bong-hwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.03,0:05:48.82,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Jongno Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.90,0:05:56.10,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Chief Chan, his last name is Chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:58.07,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,he calls himself the best cook in the area,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:06:00.20,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I think I'm losing because of my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.37,0:06:02.98,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,When we start promoting Korean cuisine,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:06.67,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,all over the world the name Pu Seungmin will be known.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:08.31,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Not Chan Bong-hwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.31,0:06:10.48,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Try better and don’t talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:11.61,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:14.28,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,They won’t blame us for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:16.15,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,We are clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:18.81,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Angry dog. It might bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.87,0:06:28.17,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Well damn. They scared us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:30.00,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Come with us to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:31.37,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,It was decided,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.37,0:06:33.37,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,that the hook got stuck there while fishing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.01,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,and I was fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:36.04,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:38.13,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,There is evidence of bribes during the delivery of products.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.35,0:06:40.54,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What bribes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.78,0:06:43.52,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Quite significant in two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.31,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Does the evidence point to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:47.72,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Where did you get the idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:49.56,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,We need your testimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:51.55,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You don’t know how to pretend at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.13,0:06:55.38,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.43,0:06:57.70,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I’m sure you, like good detectives,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.70,0:06:58.90,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,it’s clear what the deal is
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:00.89,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,can’t be pulled off by a simple boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:03.54,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Poo Seungmin, eternal sous chef,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:05.71,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,worked there longer than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.71,0:07:07.07,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,He's the criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.07,0:07:08.61,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,He is in cahoots with some bigwig
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:10.51,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,and is trying to put all the blame on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:12.85,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Exactly. That's why you need to go to the police station
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.85,0:07:16.01,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,and say what you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:19.22,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I was scratching my head, why bother with such a garden,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:20.69,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,for me to leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:21.81,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,but here’s the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:24.78,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,This could have been done by the manager or someone higher up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:26.92,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Really Director Khan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:28.65,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Why this strange monologue?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:30.16,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:32.15,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What do you think? I'm delaying the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.73,0:07:34.22,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,We're in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:37.09,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:41.66,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Jang Bong-hwan, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:47.81,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You guys are so impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:49.45,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I will hire a lawyer,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.45,0:07:51.75,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I'll dig something for Poo Seungmin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:53.28,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,and I’ll come to you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:55.19,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You will solve the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.19,0:07:56.78,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,and you will be promoted, don’t you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.89,0:08:00.48,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Stop. Fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:02.55,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Do you hear? Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.16,0:08:04.42,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Leave already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.20,0:08:08.32,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:18.67,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.05,0:08:21.95,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Are you completely crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.95,0:08:23.68,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,It’s written - an angry dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.68,0:08:24.85,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Don’t come near.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:28.41,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Jang Bong-hwan! You're in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:36.05,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:38.55,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,By the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:41.10,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I have an important question. Will you answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.10,0:08:42.26,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:44.36,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Why do they give sundae gukbap in the bullpen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:46.97,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:48.60,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I hate sundae gukbap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.87,0:08:50.51,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Is this a roadside cafe for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.51,0:08:52.50,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Have you decided to relax by the highway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:54.81,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Are you complaining about the menu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.81,0:08:56.01,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I'm a chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.52,0:08:59.02,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Even in difficult times I think about food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:01.14,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,-I'm the best boss!\N-Well, you're off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:10.22,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Hold me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:13.36,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Damn. I almost died.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:19.30,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Beautiful, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:47.79,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:51.53,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Too many women I haven’t been with yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:15.68,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Help. I want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:18.32,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I really want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.41,0:11:10.57,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Am I in heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:13.54,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,No. I will live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:17.35,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What kind of rag?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:20.35,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Am I alive in the morgue?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.63,0:11:27.86,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,No, not in the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:32.76,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Reasonably, I won’t go to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.94,0:11:34.51,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I didn’t do anything wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.51,0:11:35.83,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,but also good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.48,0:11:41.50,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What is this ancient place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:55.22,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Hanok village?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.60,0:12:00.32,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I fell from such a height, why doesn’t anything hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.67,0:12:08.63,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Exactly. Squats can save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.21,0:12:11.90,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Am I alive, okay? My precious...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.51,0:12:14.90,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What? Where did the muscles go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:18.41,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Where have my precious ones gone, pumped up with such difficulty?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:23.05,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Damn. When you lose muscle, it turns into fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:25.88,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,How long was I out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:28.82,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.76,0:12:30.92,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:15.53,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,This is a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:18.67,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Almost died, and still women are on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.78,0:13:19.97,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.45,0:13:24.38,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,But I should dream that I am with a woman, and not instead of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:27.98,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,There is a fine line between a good dream and a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.19,0:13:31.95,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,But I saw this woman somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:33.68,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,On Instagram?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.36,0:13:37.55,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,No. We saw each other in person somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.03,0:13:40.39,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Sooyeon? Chaeyoung?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:47.50,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Lake Ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:49.68,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Has your voice changed too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.68,0:13:50.87,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.61,0:13:54.35,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You have finally woken up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.35,0:13:56.24,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I knew that you would wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.22,0:13:58.47,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.02,0:14:01.01,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:05.52,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,-Don’t move.\N-What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:08.85,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You are still unwell, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.41,0:14:26.64,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,That's it. This is how a dream should be. How nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:32.41,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What is this? Terrible taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.75,0:14:35.01,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,So unpleasant to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.42,0:14:38.88,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Why do I feel taste in my dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:42.32,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I’ll ask you to redo it and add licorice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:46.59,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Is this not a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:52.26,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.55,0:14:57.03,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:15:00.20,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I shouldn’t have left you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.31,0:15:02.35,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I repent so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.35,0:15:05.97,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,that I won’t leave you for another minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:13.35,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.65,0:15:35.87,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:48.25,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.66,0:15:49.75,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:51.62,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.36,0:15:53.89,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Oh-oh-oh, my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.53,0:15:56.33,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Wait, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:58.03,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:16:00.13,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Your Highness!\N-Lord have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.31,0:16:02.51,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Get up.\N-Where...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.51,0:16:03.60,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:08.97,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Why are they being persecuted? It's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:15.09,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness! You shouldn't run like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.09,0:16:17.38,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:20.79,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness, where are you running away to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.79,0:16:23.23,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,It’s dangerous to run like that! Very dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.23,0:16:24.92,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Please wait, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:26.25,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:28.22,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:31.59,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Your Highness!\N-Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.87,0:16:33.03,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.21,0:16:36.53,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.11,0:16:38.33,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:39.71,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Wait, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.71,0:16:41.41,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,She’s not Hong Gildon, where do such abilities come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:42.45,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.45,0:16:43.72,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Your Highness!\N-I beg you, don’t run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.72,0:16:45.11,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Your Highness!\N-Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:46.61,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:49.68,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Is this a palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:53.46,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Strange, very strange.\N-Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:55.02,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,If this is not a dream, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.23,0:16:56.43,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What does all this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:58.16,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Stop.\N-Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.16,0:17:00.10,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Your Highness!\N-Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:01.69,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:07.70,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,But what’s really strange is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:11.10,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,while I was running, nothing stopped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:14.97,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.65,0:17:18.07,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Where are my relatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:21.51,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-You shouldn’t do that.\N-Dear ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:23.21,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.52,0:17:25.25,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:27.92,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I will personally search everything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.93,0:17:29.32,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Don't come near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:33.36,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,It turns out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:36.12,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I'm impotent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.64,0:17:37.67,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.67,0:17:40.83,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,You can’t run like that, you could get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:45.30,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What have you done to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:48.91,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,If you are concerned about your health,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.91,0:17:51.01,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,contact the royal physician.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.35,0:17:54.29,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I don’t care who he is, just let him poke his nose in,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:56.68,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I’ll make him impotent too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:01.58,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:04.16,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Do human traffickers do this kind of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:06.69,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Why would they kidnap a man and maim him like that? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:10.67,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Who hired you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:13.26,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Is that idiot Poo Seungmin\N taking his anger out on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.77,0:18:14.86,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.14,0:18:17.57,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Or maybe Director Khan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:20.05,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Is that why you operated on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:21.55,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What, should I order you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.55,0:18:25.37,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,can you easily change the gender of a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:38.49,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,But why are you all dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:43.29,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,As if I had made a time jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:54.40,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.09,0:19:06.55,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What year were you born?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.09,0:19:09.85,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I was born on May 31, 1988 under the sign of Gemini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.93,0:19:13.86,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Where do you live?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.97,0:19:15.90,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Seoul, Jongno-gu, Sambonro 31
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.56,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Sojeong Parkville, apartment 302.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.67,0:19:21.06,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What are your parents' names?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.44,0:19:23.51,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Father's name is Chang Giryong, mother's name is Lee Sujin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.51,0:19:25.21,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,One teaches Chinese, and the other teaches Korean history.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.21,0:19:26.24,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,They are convinced teachers,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:28.17,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,and I’m their crazy, idiotic and only son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.55,0:19:30.87,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What? Anything else you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.51,0:19:54.90,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Can you tickle me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:58.80,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:04.87,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,So this is not a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.12,0:20:06.64,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Everything is too real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:09.45,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Then the only explanation is my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.45,0:20:11.81,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,went back in time and inhabited this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:14.78,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I can wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:17.22,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,And my soul will leave this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:20.06,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.27,0:20:22.89,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Tell me everything you know about this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.57,0:20:24.76,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,This woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:27.76,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I'm talking to myself. Tell me what happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.71,0:20:30.24,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,It’s all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:31.97,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I didn’t know that you left without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:34.74,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I deserve to die, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.35,0:20:37.92,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I would kill you if this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.92,0:20:39.51,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,would solve my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.45,0:20:41.71,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,But it won’t work that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.69,0:20:44.18,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:46.65,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Don’t cry. Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.36,0:20:50.49,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,When and where did I go alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.30,0:20:53.46,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.77,0:20:56.70,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,2 nights ago you said you were tired,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.70,0:20:58.99,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,and therefore asked me to prepare the room for bed early.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.21,0:21:02.63,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,And I definitely checked that you were sleeping,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:04.67,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,before returning to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.69,0:21:17.09,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Why should we patrol?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.09,0:21:19.68,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Our status is too high for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.09,0:21:21.96,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,You have only been working in the palace for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.96,0:21:23.52,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Do you have such a high status?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.66,0:21:25.36,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,You are His Majesty's elder brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:27.09,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,And I am His Majesty’s best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.10,0:21:28.59,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,This is our status.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.63,0:21:30.46,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Speak like one of the ministers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:33.80,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Oh, exactly. Have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.91,0:21:35.73,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,About a girl or a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.87,0:21:38.63,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Every time you whisper and get so worried,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.84,0:21:40.27,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,talk about one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.31,0:21:42.24,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the ghost of a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:43.74,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,About both, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.05,0:21:46.68,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,About the spirit of water from that lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.07,0:22:04.54,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,They jumped into the water and saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:06.87,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,The doctor checked the pulse and said everything was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.87,0:22:08.04,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,But, what’s strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:12.33,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,you haven’t woken up all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.41,0:22:15.00,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,And then you just woke up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.32,0:22:18.74,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Tochnyak, water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.98,0:22:20.99,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,She and I both fell into the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.99,0:22:22.74,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,And there our souls got mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:26.25,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Take me to the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.23,0:22:35.86,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I told you not to follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.43,0:22:38.50,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I just can’t remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:40.14,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,as she fell into the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.14,0:22:41.30,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Frets?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.87,0:22:44.97,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,You damn henchmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.38,0:22:47.64,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,They won’t let you jump into the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.28,0:22:51.25,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Are we going right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:53.38,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,This is one palace. Why is it so far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.12,0:22:55.81,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,We are almost there, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.55,0:22:59.81,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,The lake you fell into is behind that stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.23,0:23:02.38,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Ambush!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.63,0:23:04.85,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.63,0:23:08.79,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.17,0:23:10.33,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.94,0:23:13.03,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Your Highness, don’t do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.97,0:23:15.24,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.24,0:23:17.23,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.64,0:23:19.47,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.88,0:23:21.77,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,This is dangerous, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:29.44,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Let's go back. Back to my life and my precious body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.59,0:23:32.18,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I will sometimes do good deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.49,0:23:34.98,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Please, Almighty, Buddha, Virgin Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.67,0:23:45.39,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.75,0:23:58.51,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Are you really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.08,0:24:01.14,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Why isn’t there water there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.55,0:24:04.65,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Drought, bombed or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.16,0:24:06.83,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,So that this doesn’t happen again,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.83,0:24:08.78,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,the water has been drained, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.06,0:24:11.19,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,And you weren’t in a hurry to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.53,0:24:13.37,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.37,0:24:14.83,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.83,0:24:16.90,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Damn. It's fucking "Your Highness."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.90,0:24:18.73,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I’m just going to be sick right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.47,0:24:20.96,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Why are you calling me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.11,0:24:24.94,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Her Destined Highness is not feeling very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.94,0:24:27.00,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Address her as Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.15,0:24:28.34,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.98,0:24:32.04,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,"Destined Highness"? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.45,0:24:36.08,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,You were chosen before the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.22,0:24:38.35,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Therefore you are called the Destined Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.89,0:24:41.12,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,"Elected"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.19,0:24:44.30,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Then that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.30,0:24:47.09,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,You will become queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.53,0:24:53.70,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,So you are now saying that I will be the king's wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.61,0:24:55.76,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.84,0:25:01.54,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I’m going crazy now, seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.75,0:25:03.68,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Forgive us,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.68,0:25:05.27,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.08,0:25:41.19,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,How can you be so beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.19,0:25:42.52,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,So handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.52,0:25:44.46,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,And what graceful fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.46,0:25:46.41,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Oh, mommies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.99,0:26:15.18,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.42,0:26:17.96,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,2 hours have already passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.96,0:26:19.68,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I’m worried about your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.76,0:26:23.18,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I would advise you to finish for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.50,0:26:24.62,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Chief Eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.50,0:26:27.89,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,For the king in charge of the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.03,0:26:31.53,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,the desire to produce an heir should be a priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.10,0:26:34.94,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I am extremely tired, this task is very tiring for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.94,0:26:37.37,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I can’t stop learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.55,0:26:47.98,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Okay, the option that I travel in time is nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.25,0:26:49.51,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,But why a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.75,0:26:52.35,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,And not just any kind, but just about the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.29,0:26:54.96,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I don’t believe in marriages.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.96,0:26:56.48,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Why should I be the king’s wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.03,0:26:58.15,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.03,0:27:02.02,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,If I become queen, does that mean I come from a noble family?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.43,0:27:06.16,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Would you like to take a bath, madam?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.21,0:27:12.77,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Call me Your Highness. Call all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.01,0:27:15.70,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.41,0:27:18.51,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I am the queen. Also?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.92,0:27:20.92,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.92,0:27:22.58,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,So I command you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.12,0:27:25.45,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,It was so infuriating, but now it’s just music to my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.76,0:27:27.98,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.53,0:27:31.03,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Fill the lake with water now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.03,0:27:32.22,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,This is an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.33,0:27:36.32,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Easy, what didn’t you think of right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.30,0:27:40.29,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,We cannot, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.77,0:27:42.93,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.48,0:27:48.30,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,You will come to your senses when I show you my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.22,0:27:58.81,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Have mercy, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.67,0:28:01.08,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,I deserve to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.08,0:28:03.50,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,But still. Please have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.41,0:28:08.91,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Huh? What kind of reaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.54,0:28:12.56,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Finally came to my senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.31,0:28:17.08,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Since he torments the ladies of the court like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.08,0:28:19.37,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,obviously, she is completely healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.14,0:28:22.44,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Bring her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.14,0:28:24.44,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.65,0:28:36.35,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,His Majesty wishes to see you in his gazebo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.33,0:28:40.69,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.04,0:28:44.16,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.90,0:28:50.90,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Yeah, the local boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.24,0:29:22.53,Default,SINGER,0,0,0,,Well, as you would expect, energy to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.78,0:29:26.44,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you won’t believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.61,0:29:32.54,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,What in the name of peace happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.41,0:29:36.35,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,-Yes, it’s a mere trifle.\N-A trifle?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.36,0:29:40.38,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,You must look neat\Nand behave according to your status.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.38,0:29:42.72,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand,\Njust listen, this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.72,0:29:44.06,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Scientist
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.36,0:29:47.50,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,should wake up with the first roosters in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.50,0:29:50.53,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,look neat and don’t like...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.13,0:29:54.67,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Don’t forget about...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.04,0:29:57.97,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Don’t forget about your conscience, always be good-natured!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.87,0:30:01.97,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Then we'll talk about philosophy.\NSomething important happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.44,0:30:05.21,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I urgently need water.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.21,0:30:08.65,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,Eunuch, bring water to the future queen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.65,0:30:11.18,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,That’s not what I’m talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.18,0:30:12.85,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I need a lake!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.80,0:30:15.42,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,There is no water left in the lakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.80,0:30:17.62,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Do you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.62,0:30:20.22,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,so that I fill the lake with water?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.57,0:30:23.16,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.19,0:30:24.36,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I can’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.27,0:30:29.10,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,-Why?\N-This is the order of the dowager queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.13,0:30:32.87,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,I will fill the lake with water -\NI will go against her order.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.64,0:30:35.01,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Well, which one of you is king?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.52,0:30:39.14,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,What kind of king are you,\Ncan’t even fill a lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.38,0:30:45.48,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I must listen to the dowager queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.49,0:30:49.02,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,she is very concerned about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.33,0:30:52.52,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Besides, I agree with the decision to drain the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.36,0:30:56.66,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,And what's good about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.27,0:30:58.80,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Explain to me normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.47,0:31:03.54,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.54,0:31:05.17,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.25,0:31:14.15,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,How dare you raise your hand against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.15,0:31:16.82,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,You seem to have decided that you are a respectable scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.82,0:31:19.33,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,But is it possible to hold your nose when sitting in front of someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.33,0:31:20.82,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,isn’t this the height of indecency?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.89,0:31:29.13,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I'm glad you've recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.43,0:31:31.13,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I was very worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.43,0:31:34.57,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Yeah, it carries sincerity a kilometer away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.20,0:31:37.70,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Have you always talked like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.75,0:31:41.11,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I almost died,\NI’m just filled with rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.55,0:31:43.87,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,How did you even fall into the lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.35,0:31:49.18,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,The future queen does not remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.62,0:31:52.08,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Don’t remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.45,0:31:53.78,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Strange how.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.62,0:31:56.95,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,So you read the “Septateuch”!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.95,0:31:59.22,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I love this collection!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.74,0:32:05.33,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I hate it when people touch my books.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.37,0:32:09.70,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,How can this be?\NI touched your book.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.17,0:32:13.35,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,She’s already dirty anyway.\NLet me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.35,0:32:17.44,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Stop it!\NA wife must obey a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.52,0:32:20.11,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,She must obey her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.65,0:32:21.91,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.91,0:32:23.95,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,-You said “man.”\N-Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.95,0:32:25.92,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Yin does not oppose yang,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.92,0:32:29.22,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,and the wife submits to her husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.00,0:32:31.79,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Are we living in Joseon?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.86,0:32:33.19,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,In Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.53,0:32:35.39,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,And you probably imagine yourself to be a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.04,0:32:37.96,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I am the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.63,0:32:41.77,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Ancestors, help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.44,0:32:47.20,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Disgusting woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.88,0:32:52.08,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.09,0:32:56.28,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Release.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.49,0:33:00.42,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Let go of the book, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.59,0:33:02.72,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Something is unclean here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.83,0:33:06.16,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.60,0:33:11.46,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,It’s time to receive the officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.81,0:33:14.20,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Is it time yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.67,0:33:17.47,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,The day of the king ruling the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.47,0:33:19.64,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,stretches like an endless strip...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.64,0:33:22.84,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Okay, you're busy! I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.67,0:33:52.04,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,Eunuch!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.05,0:33:53.94,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.03,0:34:19.36,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,Eunuch,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.70,0:34:22.67,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,you know how much I treasured this collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.01,0:34:26.78,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,With age I have become slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.78,0:34:29.17,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,The hand slipped, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.24,0:34:32.74,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,This book costs \Nas much as three of your monthly salaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.22,0:34:35.18,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I deserve to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.55,0:34:41.62,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,No, you won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.95,0:34:44.20,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,No matter how expensive this book is,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.20,0:34:46.86,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,human life is much more valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.07,0:34:50.66,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Your mercy is limitless, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.03,0:34:56.60,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,You strive for knowledge\Nwith the same zeal as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.91,0:35:00.40,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I will prepare new books for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.01,0:35:03.21,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,But now I have a meeting with officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.76,0:35:09.01,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Servants,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.09,0:35:11.75,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,prepare my palanquin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.22,0:35:17.89,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Give me a lift.\NThe places here are full.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.20,0:35:22.99,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I don’t want to, it will be cramped together.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.74,0:35:26.56,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,And finally wash yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.41,0:35:30.77,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.34,0:35:41.25,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,What?\NWhat a clever worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.34,0:35:57.13,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Your Highness, do not sit on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.16,0:35:59.26,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,How my back hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.47,0:36:12.31,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Lost your memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.28,0:36:21.25,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I’m sure everything is not so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.99,0:36:25.03,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Before an important event, the illness worsened.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.03,0:36:26.66,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,She convinced herself that she was a different person,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.66,0:36:29.03,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,to escape from the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.86,0:36:58.46,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Only I and the Dowager Queen heard this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.93,0:37:02.76,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,If anyone mentions what they heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.61,0:37:08.77,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,This will never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.68,0:37:14.17,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Find a way to cure Her Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.84,0:37:16.04,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Required.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.53,0:37:46.94,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,How can we make a girl queen who doesn’t know her own name?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.47,0:37:51.34,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,We can tell her what her name is,\Nto help bring back her memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.34,0:37:53.04,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.99,0:37:55.75,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Do you want to meet her?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.22,0:37:57.59,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,Many eyes are directed at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.59,0:37:59.66,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,No need to give people a reason
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.66,0:38:01.53,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,discuss the one who doesn’t recognize her own family.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.53,0:38:04.69,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Very few people will know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.97,0:38:08.99,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,This is what worries me,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.99,0:38:11.56,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,why did she wander alone at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.66,0:38:12.96,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Someone
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.07,0:38:17.50,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,deceived her by passing on a fake order from the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.41,0:38:21.04,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,So it will be difficult to find out anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.95,0:38:23.61,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,But who dared?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.89,0:38:32.98,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,She woke up?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.97,0:38:39.06,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.09,0:38:45.13,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I'm sure the talisman worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.26,0:38:48.07,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,And this shaman is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.41,0:38:55.41,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,If something happens,\Nreport to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.22,0:38:59.98,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Rumors are circulating around the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.24,0:39:01.99,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,like a girl chosen
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.99,0:39:04.31,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,for the role of a concubine,\N pushed the king's bride into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.49,0:39:06.88,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,She will not become a royal concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.16,0:39:09.93,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,What's her name? What about Hwajin?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.93,0:39:11.05,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.93,0:39:15.03,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I needed a reason, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.34,0:39:17.64,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Besides, her family is in decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.64,0:39:19.40,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Even with embers
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.30,0:39:22.93,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,you should be extremely careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.20,0:39:25.94,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,Regarding the change in the law on the civil service,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.11,0:39:29.32,Default,PINEAPPEN,0,0,0,,conservative and progressive parties\Ncould not reach a consensus.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.32,0:39:31.78,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Resolve our dispute, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.41,0:39:33.71,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I believe
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.36,0:39:37.38,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,that the progressive party,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.53,0:39:40.65,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,no, conservative...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.76,0:39:45.52,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.11,0:39:53.53,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Progressive Party
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.53,0:39:55.64,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,demands the repeal of this law,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.64,0:39:58.01,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,but then we will face serious economic damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.01,0:39:59.20,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,My advice -
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.20,0:40:01.77,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,this is a gradual repeal of the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.47,0:40:05.34,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Right off the tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.62,0:40:10.78,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Next on the agenda
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.78,0:40:12.48,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,royal marriage theme.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.26,0:40:15.02,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I don’t know if you heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.36,0:40:17.79,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,but my bride has finally woken up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.26,0:40:19.37,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.37,0:40:21.74,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,terrible rumors are circulating around the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.74,0:40:25.50,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,as if your fiancee is out of her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.16,0:40:28.33,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.97,0:40:31.13,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,This is the first time I’ve heard of something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.97,0:40:33.91,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,And the fact that she woke up,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.91,0:40:35.77,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I found out because we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.28,0:40:39.71,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Am I the last to know all the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.12,0:40:42.65,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,These are just rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.05,0:40:46.18,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,We didn’t want to worry you,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.18,0:40:49.19,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,so they kept silent about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.43,0:40:50.86,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,How caring you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.86,0:40:52.12,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I'm sure of these rumors
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.93,0:40:55.46,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,there is a grain of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.11,0:40:59.41,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,When we met,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.41,0:41:01.60,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,she actually behaved a little differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.28,0:41:05.87,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,She said that she doesn’t remember how she fell into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.30,0:41:09.21,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,The virgin lost her memories from shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.64,0:41:11.45,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,So something terrible happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.45,0:41:12.51,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.51,0:41:14.95,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I don’t believe that her fall
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.95,0:41:17.05,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.05,0:41:19.16,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.16,0:41:20.32,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Shortly before
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.32,0:41:22.39,Default,PINEANANCER,0,0,0,,eunuch, passing near the lake,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.39,0:41:24.89,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,saw a strange woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.89,0:41:26.36,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,-Strange woman?\N-Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.64,0:41:39.30,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,And who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.01,0:41:42.07,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,According to the palace records,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.07,0:41:45.41,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,only one woman entered the palace at that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.32,0:41:48.35,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Daughter of Cho Daesu,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.59,0:41:50.15,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Cho Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.55,0:41:55.79,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,How dare you suspect her?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.16,0:42:00.16,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Hwajin has no reason to harm the king's bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.47,0:42:03.46,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,She will become the royal concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.03,0:42:05.76,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,The girl wanted to become a queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.30,0:42:08.87,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,so she harmed her rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.28,0:42:12.50,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Cho Hwajin is innocent, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.14,0:42:17.05,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Everyone knows how devoted Cho Daesu is to the court and state.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.05,0:42:18.88,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,And his daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.34,0:42:22.26,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,is known for her nobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.26,0:42:23.81,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,This is treason!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.16,0:42:26.59,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.59,0:42:29.05,Default,PINEANANCE,0,0,0,,Why did she secretly come to the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.05,0:42:31.09,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Is it to meet the Dowager Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.09,0:42:33.02,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Be clear, what are you accusing her of?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.97,0:42:35.64,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,You won’t get away with this so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.64,0:42:36.76,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Sovereign,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.30,0:42:40.23,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,I ask you, conduct an investigation,\Nfind out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.61,0:42:42.17,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,And severely punish the culprit!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.30,0:43:04.52,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.43,0:43:11.86,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,It’s even somehow awkward to admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.30,0:43:14.77,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Cho Hwajin
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.64,0:43:18.64,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,spent that night with me. From start to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.84,0:43:22.64,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,-What?\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.84,0:43:23.95,Default,PINEAPPELLER,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.95,0:43:26.22,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Of course, there has been no ceremony yet
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.22,0:43:28.01,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,and she has not yet been proclaimed a concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.49,0:43:30.55,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,But I am a young man, in the prime of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.86,0:43:34.89,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Although you yourself know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.89,0:43:37.95,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,You will know everything long before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.07,0:43:40.76,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Since we’ve discussed everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.76,0:43:42.49,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I suggest not delaying the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.49,0:43:44.70,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,So that I can quickly acquire concubines. How do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.01,0:43:46.07,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,But this...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.07,0:43:47.76,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,As for the recent incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.76,0:43:50.61,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,everything will be resolved when the future queen remembers everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.61,0:43:52.94,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Let's not draw conclusions ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.24,0:43:55.45,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I can’t watch you bickering here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.45,0:43:57.47,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,While you are swearing, other things are idle.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.59,0:44:05.78,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.49,0:44:11.32,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,If the ceremony takes place,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.32,0:44:12.79,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,the Kims will run everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.03,0:44:15.76,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,His Majesty is clearly favorable to Cho Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.76,0:44:17.83,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Which means that all is not lost yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.91,0:44:22.47,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,The future of the Punyan Cho family
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.91,0:44:24.80,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,depends on Cho Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.91,0:44:29.57,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Let's start by making\N her royal concubine,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.47,0:44:32.48,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,and then we’ll come up with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.62,0:44:35.51,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,The ceremony will still take place.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.78,0:44:38.62,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,So why don’t you have a face?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.39,0:44:43.25,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,The battle ahead of us is not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.30,0:45:00.94,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I lack knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.28,0:45:03.91,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,we have to rely on you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.91,0:45:06.38,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,-Forgive me. \N-Well, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.68,0:45:11.95,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Every day you are getting better and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.62,0:45:15.22,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,You are too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.49,0:45:17.36,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Even with your help
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.36,0:45:19.46,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I can hardly cope.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.82,0:45:24.03,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,And I didn’t take into account that you need\N to put your male energy somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.70,0:45:26.90,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.11,0:45:30.83,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Why, I should apologize for not taking into account such an important detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.37,0:45:34.05,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,However, in relationships with women
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.05,0:45:36.07,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,you still need to be guided by your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.18,0:45:38.98,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,The inner palace remains part of the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.55,0:45:40.91,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,And we must not forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.51,0:45:44.28,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,that your wife is higher than your concubines.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.22,0:45:46.95,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I’ll try not to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.22,0:45:50.76,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Besides, we need to establish the identity of that mysterious lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.76,0:45:53.06,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,which the eunuch saw at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.30,0:45:56.93,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,We need to make sure that she doesn’t end up in such a delicate situation again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.64,0:45:59.80,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.57,0:46:02.03,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,You are right, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.11,0:46:33.60,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Forgive me, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.84,0:46:37.03,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,How come it took you so long to write this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.18,0:46:57.69,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,If it weren’t for you, I would never have finished writing the poem.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.16,0:46:59.89,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,And she wouldn’t be so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.47,0:47:03.03,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Flatter me, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.39,0:47:05.64,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.64,0:47:08.60,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,They brought a decree from the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.14,0:47:16.11,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Listen to His Majesty’s decree.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.72,0:47:23.05,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Cho Hwajin, daughter of the chief court secretary Cho Daesu,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.05,0:47:24.89,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,notified that tomorrow after the marriage ceremony will be held
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.89,0:47:27.55,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,view of the choice of the royal\N concubine. As one of the candidates
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.55,0:47:29.02,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,she should come to the palace immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.39,0:47:38.23,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,How refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.93,0:47:42.33,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,You need to add more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.37,0:47:47.10,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Now we’ll add some more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.87,0:47:50.67,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Pour some water, pour some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.12,0:47:52.44,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Exactly, water.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.84,0:47:54.48,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Water is exactly the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.41,0:47:59.35,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Will I even be able to return if I fall into some body of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.66,0:48:01.92,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,That’s how I actually got here through the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.89,0:48:04.39,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Are there other lakes here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.39,0:48:07.19,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,There are two more on the territory of the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.09,0:48:10.23,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,-Really? \N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.57,0:48:13.03,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,But they are no different from what you saw before.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.64,0:48:14.97,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,How is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.70,0:48:18.27,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,According to the decree of the Dowager Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.37,0:48:21.40,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,all the lakes in the palace have been drained.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.78,0:48:23.74,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Every single one?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.05,0:48:25.41,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.95,0:48:27.14,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,And will this last for a long time?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.45,0:48:29.88,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Forever, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.12,0:48:33.05,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,What is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.95,0:48:37.12,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Am I stuck here forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.66,0:48:39.82,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Forever?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.59,0:48:44.76,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.07,0:48:53.14,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Water! We need to test all the waters in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.78,0:48:56.81,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I have to go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.84,0:48:59.89,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.89,0:49:01.04,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.18,0:49:03.86,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.86,0:49:06.42,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,-Your Highness!\N-This is waste water, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.53,0:49:08.82,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.70,0:49:11.82,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Don’t do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.74,0:49:17.89,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.53,0:49:21.10,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,My back was pinched.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.26,0:49:24.17,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,-Bend over and drag! \N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.14,0:49:28.24,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,-Your Highness! Why did you stick your little head there!\N-Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.24,0:49:30.47,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Who do you want to leave us with?!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.05,0:49:36.38,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,So I knew it. You need to jump into the pond.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.80,0:49:47.09,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,What a shock you experienced,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.37,0:49:49.69,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,that you do such things when you see water.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.47,0:50:03.81,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,And you’re a cutie. What's your name there?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.09,0:50:08.51,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Honyong. My name is Hongyong.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.45,0:50:12.85,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,How bad it is for you that you forgot the one who took care of you
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.05,0:50:16.15,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,from your very birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.37,0:50:24.73,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Well, why are you crying? It's painful to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.41,0:50:28.67,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Your Highness, I brought the medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.22,0:50:37.07,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Aren’t you ashamed to shed tears in front of Her Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.22,0:50:39.14,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,If it’s hard for anyone here, it’s her.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.39,0:50:40.58,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.78,0:50:43.95,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,And that’s true. It's hard for me, it's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.66,0:50:46.28,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,You two will never understand
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.93,0:50:48.75,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,bitterness from the loss of the most important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.80,0:50:56.13,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Pack your things and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.84,0:51:04.13,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Since I won’t be able to return soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.47,0:51:07.24,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,will have to adjust. \NWe need to find out what and how.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.74,0:51:10.97,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.18,0:51:13.74,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,What is that goat's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.59,0:51:16.01,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,What is the name of your king?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.59,0:51:20.45,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,The name of the king is sacred, how can I tell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.68,0:51:21.85,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Damn, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.95,0:51:24.25,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,You cannot address him by name, nor just call him by name.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.82,0:51:27.82,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,We are in the state of Joseon? What year is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.82,0:51:29.26,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,1851.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.49,0:51:33.03,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,The second year of the reign of Prince Togwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.41,0:51:36.11,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Prince Togwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.11,0:51:37.90,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I heard this name somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.47,0:51:39.84,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Can I give you another hint?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.14,0:51:43.37,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Hint?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.64,0:51:47.91,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do it this way. I will sing a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.91,0:51:49.85,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,If you hear the posthumous name of the king's predecessor, give a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.09,0:51:51.25,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.49,0:51:55.86,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Tae, John, Tae, Se, Moon, Dan, Se,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.86,0:51:58.22,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Ye, Song, Young, Jun, In, Myung, Song.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.30,0:52:03.76,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Still not there? This means \Nthis king is one of the later ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.37,0:52:06.53,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Kwan, In, Hyo, Hyun, Suk, Kyung, Young,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.53,0:52:08.43,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Chon, Sun, Hong, Chol, Ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.14,0:52:10.23,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.74,0:52:16.01,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Ko, Chol, Hong, Sun...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.12,0:52:20.74,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Sun, Hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.95,0:52:24.65,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Where did the fly come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.03,0:52:28.85,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,If he comes after King Hongjong, then he...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.20,0:52:33.56,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Choljong?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.16,0:52:38.63,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Choljong. Born Lee Wonbum.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.64,0:52:40.87,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Becoming king, changed his name to Lee Byung.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.87,0:52:42.57,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,His relatives were accused of treason
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.57,0:52:44.03,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,and exiled to Ganghwado Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.03,0:52:48.10,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Joseon Cinderella, the one who, due to stupidity\N, was made king overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.28,0:52:51.18,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,The most stupid and useless\N puppet king in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.18,0:52:53.04,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Hated by the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.22,0:52:55.41,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,He fell ill and died in the 13th year of his reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.62,0:53:00.05,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Teachers and parents were right, teaching is still light!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.05,0:53:01.28,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Maman, from the bottom of my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.89,0:53:05.72,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,When people get hit too quickly, they become greyhounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.93,0:53:08.76,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,This one is one of those, but so far it behaves decently.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.07,0:53:14.76,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I did not know about your condition, and therefore my behavior was inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.03,0:53:17.37,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Let me feel your forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.20,0:53:20.40,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.37,0:53:25.14,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Why be embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.24,0:53:28.14,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Tomorrow you will become my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.22,0:53:31.38,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.99,0:53:35.62,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I asked the ministers to hurry things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.62,0:53:37.72,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,And still hold the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.72,0:53:41.79,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is our wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.43,0:53:45.73,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Well, we’ve arrived, I forgot about the most important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.97,0:53:47.03,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Choljon put it on everything
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.03,0:53:48.77,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,because of booze and girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.97,0:53:50.83,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,The main Joseon male.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.18,0:53:56.27,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.02,0:54:00.29,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,First I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.57,0:54:13.31,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I did as you asked and sent everyone away.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.38,0:54:14.81,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.18,0:54:19.78,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,In general, this is very difficult to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.05,0:54:22.35,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I don’t even know how to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.72,0:54:24.15,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Why is everything so complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.72,0:54:27.62,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,-You have something in your hair.\N-What? What's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.16,0:54:32.53,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Petal.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.73,0:54:37.60,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,In general, you will be shocked,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.67,0:54:39.40,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,but try to accept it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.27,0:54:45.24,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,-Actually I...\N-Really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.58,0:54:49.75,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.45,0:54:59.02,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Healthy man,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.02,0:55:00.96,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,comes from the future of Joseon, which is 200 years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.26,0:55:03.13,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I don’t know how this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.13,0:55:04.99,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I thought I was drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.99,0:55:06.23,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I’m coming to my senses, and I’m a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.46,0:55:09.77,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,In general, I’m not who you think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.77,0:55:11.43,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Appearances can be deceiving, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.84,0:55:16.41,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I bet you think what the hell I’m talking about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.51,0:55:19.11,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,In any case, you should seriously reconsider everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.11,0:55:21.81,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Let's say the ceremony is held,\Nthe time for the wedding night will come and...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.25,0:55:23.98,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,All this is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.15,0:55:27.05,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,And I don’t like men.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.32,0:55:30.65,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,And you won’t be envied at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.65,0:55:32.29,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I just have a personality disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.29,0:55:35.63,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,And you have a same-sex marriage! Illegal girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.30,0:55:42.47,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I understand what you are trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.50,0:55:46.77,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Seriously, or what? Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.94,0:55:49.77,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,you’re a normal guy, it looks like the textbooks lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.44,0:55:51.61,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Listen here!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.01,0:55:54.38,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.38,0:55:56.28,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Tell the court physician,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.28,0:55:58.88,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,to find out what’s wrong with my fiancee and notify me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.72,0:56:00.82,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.15,0:56:02.29,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.99,0:56:06.22,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.22,0:56:09.73,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I will definitely cure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.23,0:56:13.33,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Remember that you are not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.80,0:56:17.20,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,I am your future husband and I will not leave you, no matter how bad you are
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.87,0:56:21.27,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,and no matter how damaged your mind is.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.74,0:56:28.81,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. You're not well yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.88,0:56:29.98,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Listen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.61,0:56:33.08,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Take my bride back to her chambers immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.08,0:56:34.62,Default,TOLYANYCH,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.68,0:56:36.12,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.12,0:56:39.06,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Go to bed and rest.\NYou will feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.89,0:56:43.33,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.89,0:56:45.23,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.20,0:56:47.76,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.73,0:56:50.60,Default,FE,0,0,0,,The books didn’t lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.93,0:56:53.64,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Apparently, he is even dumber than they wrote in the textbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.64,0:56:55.04,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Gain strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.34,0:56:58.71,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.21,0:57:03.61,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you cannot walk with your skirts raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.18,0:57:06.68,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Should not show underwear when stepping.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.05,0:57:10.45,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Your Highness, go slower. Don't run like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.32,0:57:14.89,Default,FE,0,0,0,,What is she up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.36,0:57:19.30,Default,FE,0,0,0,,If I don’t want to, I won’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.30,0:57:21.80,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Western medicine works better for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.87,0:57:25.80,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.87,0:57:27.97,Default,FU,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.27,0:57:29.67,Default,FU,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.61,0:57:31.71,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.65,0:57:39.48,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.20,0:57:58.87,Default,FE,0,0,0,,The energy of water fills the head of Her Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.87,0:58:02.04,Default,FE,0,0,0,,You need to displace it with the energy of fire using sandalwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.91,0:58:05.41,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you must remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.54,0:58:08.48,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Oh, you charlatan! Do you have a doctor's license?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.48,0:58:11.81,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Why are you making a tobacco chicken out of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.39,0:58:22.99,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I will open to you the thirteenth chakra, which is the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.99,0:58:24.09,Default,FE,0,0,0,,for illnesses of the mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.19,0:58:26.63,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Don’t care, do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.63,0:58:28.30,Default,FE,0,0,0,,The body is not mine anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.55,0:58:43.81,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.02,0:58:47.90,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Memory returned as if by magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.68,0:58:49.72,Default,FE,0,0,0,,You are Hongyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.72,0:58:52.72,Default,FE,0,0,0,,My beloved maid,\Nwith whom I grew up in my father’s house.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.53,0:59:01.20,Default,FE,0,0,0,,What is the name of this court lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.56,0:59:02.80,Default,FE,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.90,0:59:06.10,Default,FE,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.14,0:59:10.27,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Choi! Court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.98,0:59:16.65,Default,FE,0,0,0,,What’s my name then?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.62,0:59:24.45,Default,FE,0,0,0,,How do I know what to call the doctor at court?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.45,0:59:25.82,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Why are you seated?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.82,0:59:27.12,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Hold Her Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.12,0:59:29.09,Default,FE,0,0,0,,If she moves,\Nit will only get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.53,0:59:33.00,Default,FE,0,0,0,,How can you use\Nthis butcher's tool on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.00,0:59:34.26,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Fell from the oak tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.26,0:59:36.57,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I am a master of acupuncture.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.63,0:59:37.90,Default,FE,0,0,0,,This is the best way to
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.90,0:59:39.24,Default,FE,0,0,0,,clear blood flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.24,0:59:41.67,Default,FE,0,0,0,,-I’ll stick it just below the back of the head...\N-Stop! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.04,0:59:43.27,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Stop, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.77,0:59:45.27,Default,FE,0,0,0,,If I come to my senses,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.71,0:59:48.48,Default,FE,0,0,0,,then tomorrow I will be a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.11,0:59:52.92,Default,FE,0,0,0,,What do you think the payback will be
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.45,0:59:55.02,Default,FE,0,0,0,,for your ardent assault?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.02,1:00:01.69,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Overdoing is worse than underdoing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.69,1:00:04.86,Default,FE,0,0,0,,With this I will complete my inventive treatment.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.83,1:00:10.77,Default,FE,0,0,0,,That’s right, you are an excellent healer.\NI have fully recovered.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.00,1:00:12.80,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I'm fine. In order.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.44,1:00:18.37,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Okay. I will become a queen,\Nsince you want it so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.77,1:00:20.78,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Queen of an entire country.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.81,1:00:23.31,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Filling a lake or pond will be a piece of cake?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.80,1:00:48.64,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Your Highness, are you awake yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.71,1:01:23.87,Default,FU,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.26,1:01:41.72,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Do I need to wear all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.23,1:01:45.66,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Queen's formal robes
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.66,1:01:47.26,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Underwear, long johns,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.26,1:01:49.17,Default,FE,0,0,0,,loose pants, petticoat,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.17,1:01:51.03,Default,FE,0,0,0,,overwear, undershirt,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.03,1:01:53.00,Default,FE,0,0,0,,first skirt, second skirt,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.00,1:01:55.14,Default,FE,0,0,0,,third skirt, jacket with colored piping
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.14,1:01:57.64,Default,FE,0,0,0,,and the top jacket.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.51,1:02:01.04,Default,FE,0,0,0,,The clothes at the top are narrow cut and close to the body,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.04,1:02:03.11,Default,FU,0,0,0,,bottom, on the contrary, is wide.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.11,1:02:05.95,Default,FE,0,0,0,,This creates the illusion of a lady’s ideal curvaceous figure.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.95,1:02:08.75,Default,FU,0,0,0,,Small up, big down
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.59,1:02:13.06,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Can’t breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.05,1:02:44.85,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Jade beads close their eyes,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.09,1:02:48.09,Default,FE,0,0,0,,and sapphire ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.19,1:02:50.33,Default,FE,0,0,0,,A sign that the king should
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.33,1:02:52.59,Default,FE,0,0,0,,close your eyes and ears and listen to your yard.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.00,1:02:59.37,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Straighten your neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.60,1:03:00.90,Default,FE,0,0,0,,It’s heavy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.90,1:03:03.54,Default,FE,0,0,0,,You must bear this heavy burden.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.49,1:03:57.39,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I am the first Joseon woman without a bra.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.16,1:04:03.67,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Mutual bow.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.40,1:04:10.61,Default,FE,0,0,0,,-Your Highness.\N-What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.81,1:04:50.11,Default,FE,0,0,0,,We are not commemorating our ancestors here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.11,1:04:52.55,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Wedding - the same funeral.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.12,1:04:58.65,Default,FE,0,0,0,,How many times should you bow?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.65,1:05:00.12,Default,FU,0,0,0,,2 more.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.10,1:05:12.97,Default,FE,0,0,0,,What a beautiful couple they turned out to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.00,1:05:17.57,Default,FE,0,0,0,,All with your efforts and prayers, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.57,1:05:20.14,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I'm glad you noticed this, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.15,1:05:27.92,Default,PU,0,0,0,,Raise the bowls.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.68,1:06:01.68,Default,FE,0,0,0,,My brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.15,1:06:04.12,Default,FE,0,0,0,,why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.32,1:06:10.19,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I am happy that my daughter became the queen of this country,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.43,1:06:12.69,Default,FU,0,0,0,,but still -
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.16,1:06:16.30,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I feel like I lost my only child.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.43,1:06:18.93,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.64,1:06:22.40,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Now you are the queen's father.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.94,1:06:25.57,Default,FE,0,0,0,,His Lordship Yonggeun.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.67,1:06:26.88,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.84,1:06:29.14,Default,FU,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.68,1:06:38.79,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Soyeon from the Andong family of Kim
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.95,1:06:41.86,Default,FE,0,0,0,,became the queen of Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.36,1:06:44.53,Default,FE,0,0,0,,This is the first time I’ve heard this woman’s name.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.53,1:06:46.60,Default,FE,0,0,0,,You must love me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.31,1:07:07.82,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I can’t, I can’t breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.45,1:07:09.79,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Heart attack?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.18,1:07:35.14,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Show respect!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.51,1:07:40.18,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Long life to the king and queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.85,1:07:49.36,Default,FE,0,0,0,,There are no enemies or allies in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.53,1:07:53.60,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Don’t lose your balance and don’t let your heart cloud your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.86,1:07:55.66,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.66,1:07:57.10,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I'm heading to the palace,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.10,1:07:59.64,Default,FE,0,0,0,,because I want to be useful to His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.70,1:08:01.00,Default,FE,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.24,1:08:08.44,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Nurse, I will not die.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.44,1:08:10.11,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Don’t cry for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.61,1:08:13.95,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Young lady, you are too kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.35,1:08:18.02,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I don’t know if you can survive in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.69,1:08:22.06,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. I will serve my lady faithfully.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.06,1:09:33.36,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I give up! I give up!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.27,1:09:40.50,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I thought we would read poems in the gazebo.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.57,1:09:43.64,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Couldn’t you have warned\Nthat this was training and not rest?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.81,1:09:45.07,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Aren’t you resting?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.07,1:09:47.01,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Sweat in a place with this view.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.01,1:09:48.28,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Resting?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.28,1:09:50.65,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Because of the father of the Minister of War, it’s already necessary
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.65,1:09:53.32,Default,FE,0,0,0,,train every day - and I don’t even like military affairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.32,1:09:55.12,Default,FE,0,0,0,,What are we even doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.22,1:09:57.65,Default,FE,0,0,0,,If I had known, I would never have gone with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.39,1:10:02.99,Default,FE,0,0,0,,You might think you are preparing for battle with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.03,1:10:05.16,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Why were you upset by such good news?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.16,1:10:06.53,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Your cousin has become queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.63,1:10:12.13,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I have a full hanbok of happiness - I don’t know what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.47,1:10:16.51,Default,FE,0,0,0,,If you don’t like sword fighting, maybe we can fight hand-to-hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.64,1:10:20.11,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I changed my mind. I'll go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.05,1:10:25.61,Default,FE,0,0,0,,You will go when you defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.92,1:10:32.65,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Faster, faster. She dug into my neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.36,1:10:36.36,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Almost died there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.89,1:10:39.59,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Photo sessions with a stylist are \Ngarbage compared to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.21,1:10:55.98,Default,FE,0,0,0,,We got a number upgrade.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.14,1:10:57.68,Default,FE,0,0,0,,This is Daejojon Hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.65,1:11:01.22,Default,FU,0,0,0,,The name corresponds to the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.38,1:11:04.49,Default,FU,0,0,0,,It means that you have to make a big contribution.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.85,1:11:07.19,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Do you want me to save the country or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.56,1:11:08.76,Default,FE,0,0,0,,You should give birth
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.62,1:11:11.76,Default,FE,0,0,0,,to the king of the heirs.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.60,1:11:19.80,Default,FU,0,0,0,,Exactly. It's also the wedding night.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.70,1:11:24.94,Default,FE,0,0,0,,The biggest mess in all 33 years of Jang Bong-hwan’s life.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.89,1:11:42.69,Default,FE,0,0,0,,There must be a way out of any situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.79,1:11:47.90,Default,FU,0,0,0,,Must be.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.20,1:11:50.23,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Drinks have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.41,1:12:04.65,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Exactly, alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.52,1:12:08.88,Default,FE,0,0,0,,And the ancestors knew what they were doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.11,1:12:36.75,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Let me pour it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.41,1:12:40.98,Default,FE,0,0,0,,What does His Majesty want to drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.32,1:12:43.62,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I like snacks more than alcohol itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.02,1:12:45.22,Default,FE,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.59,1:12:49.69,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Today is a special day.\NDon’t eat too much and drink better.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.33,1:12:52.79,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Excessive consumption of wine harms the body.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.30,1:12:54.60,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Oh, you little...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.80,1:12:57.73,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Calm, only calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.97,1:13:01.27,Default,FE,0,0,0,,There is no Korean who would not be proud of how much he can consume.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.94,1:13:04.94,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I see. So you don't know how to drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.94,1:13:07.34,Default,FE,0,0,0,,It’s immediately obvious that you won’t drink me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.58,1:13:08.78,Default,FE,0,0,0,,And good.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.78,1:13:11.21,Default,FE,0,0,0,,All alcohol is in your favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.95,1:13:14.65,Default,FE,0,0,0,,It's bulletproof, or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.02,1:13:17.15,Default,FE,0,0,0,,No effect.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.15,1:13:19.32,Default,FU,0,0,0,,Okay. Do you want to play a game?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.89,1:13:22.52,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I know a couple of games in which you need to drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.36,1:13:24.53,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.93,1:13:26.93,Default,FU,0,0,0,,3, 6, 9, 3, 6, 9,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.93,1:13:28.76,Default,FU,0,0,0,,3, 6, 9, 3, 6, 9.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.73,1:13:33.74,Default,FE,0,0,0,,When did the multiplication table appear in Korea?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.74,1:13:36.04,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Don’t know? Then -
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.04,1:13:39.31,Default,FU,0,0,0,,magpie-crow, magpie-crow, magpie-crow,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.31,1:13:41.88,Default,PU,0,0,0,,magpie-crow, magpie-crow.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.88,1:13:44.88,Default,FE,0,0,0,,It seems that the word “shame” was invented for this case.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.88,1:13:46.18,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Hey, what aren’t you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.38,1:13:47.68,Default,FE,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.05,1:13:50.15,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I liked the idea of playing,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.55,1:13:53.66,Default,FE,0,0,0,,but you just shout “magpie-crow”. Boring.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.36,1:13:55.92,Default,FE,0,0,0,,That’s a nitpick.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.23,1:14:00.16,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Alcohol requires dancing and music.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.07,1:14:07.50,Default,FE,0,0,0,,How long can you dance to the ancient music of your ancestors?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.50,1:14:08.67,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Watch your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.67,1:14:10.34,Default,FU,0,0,0,,They go up and down.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.34,1:14:11.67,Default,FE,0,0,0,,And the glass goes down,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.67,1:14:13.98,Default,FU,0,0,0,,down, down, down.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.98,1:14:15.18,Default,FE,0,0,0,,The glass is going down,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.18,1:14:16.18,Default,FU,0,0,0,,down, down, down.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.18,1:14:17.65,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Are you that excited?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.18,1:14:25.12,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Did the music of the ancestors work?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.56,1:14:30.99,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Then let's get started?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.07,1:14:42.40,Default,FE,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.58,1:14:56.95,Default,FE,0,0,0,,We'll have to take an extreme step.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.39,1:15:42.20,Default,FE,0,0,0,,What is it like to greet a new day as a queen?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.20,1:15:43.37,Default,FE,0,0,0,,-Crap.\N-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.37,1:15:46.37,Default,FE,0,0,0,,We are preparing for a battle for power and retribution.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.37,1:15:49.44,Default,FE,0,0,0,,The only way to punish those in power is
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.44,1:15:52.17,Default,FE,0,0,0,,find evidence of their bribery and bad conscience.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.17,1:15:53.54,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Seeing her in person,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.54,1:15:56.24,Default,FE,0,0,0,,I see that the queen is still not herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.24,1:15:58.51,Default,FE,0,0,0,,It is more important for us who she should be,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.51,1:16:01.35,Default,FE,0,0,0,,than who she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.52,1:16:02.52,Default,FE,0,0,0,,This is a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.52,1:16:04.25,Default,FE,0,0,0,,If there is a good way, use it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.25,1:16:06.02,Default,FE,0,0,0,,What last resort are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.09,1:16:07.26,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Murder.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.06,2:01:39.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,

Comment: 0,1:14:21.04,1:14:25.45,Default,FE,0,0,0,,Queen Chkhorin
